<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The DR Congo military court has sentenced 66 soldiers to death for cowardice and mutiny after they fled fighting rebels, intensifying pressure on FARDC as FRN rebels advance on multiple fronts. Allied Democratic Forces militants attacked Cantine in North Kivu, raising fears of Ebola spread as patients flee treatment centres. ISIS-linked militants killed 33 people, prompting the Africa CDC to call for a humanitarian corridor to protect Ebola response. Gold smuggling is reported to finance the Islamic State-linked insurgency in the region. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/10/who-is-jean-leonard-teganya-deported-by-us-over-rwanda-genocide-claims?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5wenV4UGRtcTg3SFF4a0pKSk4xb1J0MTRkNGU4N2R3U0Jnaktrd3lkZE1NNHpDMFBrU1RzWVYzSkd1NEZoS1NDOTRsaUo4ak5FS3V6Tzl1WnFtMWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOcFJiWVBiTXZzVHBMVGxyZjBYaDFKOU0tc01fWDdlR0lkRGRoV3Roa09WVFpfbjh2QXFYdUFzV3hrWmpNMU43Wi1sOGNBZEhXeEoyTzBEOG0xLWV3ck9ERmFBcFV4QlQ0RGxoSFNOOEpkWW5qM1locUFaOUs3S1N4dEhPa2RHdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haberler.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE42eThoTlMwZmZCakp4bXdxcFk1N2ZLT0E1aHdsY0wyZl81amN3M2UzVUMyV3M2VmhYSHNFc1FuMENKd0VYdG1rdGo0TWR2anNpWTVRNlRZYTFGMXg3Vi0zaXNYRVBZQnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;PRNigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQZ2NYZGZTWW1ldnU0TFRzUzhkWUhTMkxkcVBDZGZQSVFia08waDV2cGpEVkFKZW9jTVp6Tkx1cEY5QzM3VnZvQ3VaV2djdTdIMFhydjkxMl9CLTBVUktHdkp6VTYzT1FhbnZxbk9WUGd4MFNGdE96elVKVDAwMUtEc2xheGpndzVWSkl